-day average of 823K. It didn't hold. By Jun 4, 2013 it had closed below the breakout level three days running, and the chart ends at $31.09.","lesson":"This is an example of a failed breakout where everything looked right, volume included, and the stock fell back anyway. It happens. This is why traders cut losses fast instead of hoping."}}